aph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p003","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p003:m0043","source_anchor":{"start":43,"end":45,"surface":"趙粲"},"quote":"妃性酷虐，嘗手殺數人。或以戟擲孕妾，子隨刃墮地。帝聞之，大怒，已修金墉城，將廢之。充華趙粲從容言曰：「賈妃年少，妒是婦人之情耳，長自當差。願陛下察之。」其後楊珧亦為之言曰：「陛下忘賈公閭耶？」荀勖深救之，故得不廢。惠帝即位，立為皇后，生河東、臨海、始平公主、哀獻皇女。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-031","source_id":"s-jinshu031-jia-ws2479706-comparison"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-jin031-zhaocan-death","person_id":"wqo_pil_3j9","event_type":"death","source_term":"皆伏誅","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p007","start":248,"end":251,"surface":"皆伏誅"},"date_expression":null,"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-031","source_id":"s-jinshu031-jia-ws2479706-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p007","quote":"及太子廢黜，趙王倫、孫秀等因眾怨謀欲廢后。后數遣宮婢微服於人間視聽，其謀頗泄。后甚懼，遂害太子，以絕眾望。趙王倫乃率兵入宮，使翊軍校尉齊王冏入殿廢后。后與冏母有隙，故倫使之。后驚曰：「卿何為來！」冏曰：「有詔收后。」后曰：「詔當從我出，何詔也？」后至上閤，遙呼帝曰：「陛下有婦，使人廢之，亦行自廢。」又問冏曰：「起事者誰？」冏曰：「梁、趙。」后曰：「繫狗當繫頸，今反繫其尾，何得不然！」至宮西，見謐尸，再舉聲而哭遽止。倫乃矯詔遣尚書劉弘等持節齎金屑酒賜后死。后在位十一年。趙粲、賈午、韓壽、董猛等皆伏誅。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p007:m0236"}],"interpretation_note":"本比較源無年死亡說；韓壽伏誅與040元康初卒分源並存，不改同指或強填同年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"start":43,"end":45,"surface":"趙粲","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p003:m0043","kind":"person","person_id":"wqo_pil_3j9","status":"source_attested","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"start":200,"end":202,"surface":"趙粲","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p006:m0200","kind":"person","person_id":"wqo_pil_3j9","status":"source_attested","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p006","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison"},{"start":243,"end":244,"surface":"粲","id":"c-jinshu-031-jia-comparison:p006:m0243","kind":"person","pe